    "公历与农历最多预排未来 %lld 年，按时间保留最早 %lld 条（含晨间问候）；日子较多时范围会缩短。农历日期限于 1900–2100 年。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gregorian and lunar reminders are scheduled up to %lld years ahead. Only the earliest %lld reminders, including the morning greeting, are kept, so more events shorten the coverage. Lunar dates are limited to 1900–2100."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "公历与农历最多预排未来 %lld 年，按时间保留最早 %lld 条（含晨间问候）；日子较多时范围会缩短。农历日期限于 1900–2100 年。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "公曆與農曆最多預排未來 %lld 年，按時間保留最早 %lld 條（含晨間問候）；日子較多時範圍會縮短。農曆日期限於 1900–2100 年。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
